---
description: Never start a local development server; use the user's existing one.
alwaysApply: true
---

# No agent-started dev server

- Never run `npm run dev`, `next dev`, `yarn dev`, `pnpm dev`, or any command that starts a web server.
- Never occupy port 3000 or 3001.
- If the app needs to be running, tell the user to use their existing terminal. Do not start a replacement server.
- Do not use browser tools in a way that requires launching a new Next.js process.
